&2 What's with the beggar?
&2 那个乞丐怎么回事？
&1 Just another juice addict suffering from the low supply.
&1 又一个“果汁”瘾君子，货源紧缺，犯瘾了。
&3 I don't need to talk about Kane here...
&3 没必要在这儿谈凯恩……
&4 Yeah. Police business. We had to bypass the docking ring.
