&2 You're not from this system, are you?
&2 你不是这个星系的人吧？
&3 Don't worry.  I won't report you.
&3 放心。我不会举报你。
&4 Things have been bad since the war.
&4 战争过后，日子一直不好过。
&5 We need any help we can get to turn things around.
&5 想扭转局面，多一分帮助是一分。
&5 I'm sorry I can't take you with me.
&5 抱歉，我没法带你走。
&6 I wouldn't want to come anyway.
&6 反正我也不想走。
&7 You know what they do to defectors around here.
&7 你知道这地方怎么对付叛逃者。
&8 They disappear. Nobody ever sees them again, dead or alive.
&8 人会消失。从此活不见人，死不见尸。
&9 Happened to my buddy two years ago. Gone. Forever.
&9 两年前我一个哥们就是这样。没了。永远没了。
&10 Well, I'd like to help against the Boryokudan in any way I can.
&10 只要能跟暴力团作对，我什么忙都乐意帮。
&11 So I guess you could borrow my card if you really need it.
&11 所以真需要的话，我这卡可以借你。
&6 No. I'm from here.
&6 不。我就是本地人。
&12 You don't have to lie to me, you know.
&12 你用不着骗我。
