Play
开始
You are carrying nothing.
你身上什么都没有。
Damn, I'm looking good!
该死，我看着真不赖！
&88 I can't kick that.
&88 我踢不了那个。
&4 Remember how this goes?
&4 还记得该怎么做吗？
&5 Ah.  Good to see you remember the point of entry.
&5 啊。看来您还记得起始位置。
&6 Welcome to the targeting range.  As you no doubt remember, cover is just as essential as aiming.
&6 欢迎来到靶场。您想必还记得，掩体和瞄准同样重要。
&7 You are currently in the 'cover' position.
&7 您现在处于“掩体”位置。
&8 You have two positions available to you: in cover, and out of cover.  You will only be able to fire when out of cover.
&8 您有两种姿态可选：掩体内，以及掩体外。只有在掩体外才能开火。
&9 To alternate between the two, tap the 'A' and 'D' keys.
&9 按“A”和“D”键在两者间切换。
It looks like some kind of weapon.
看起来像是某种武器。
&10 I see... perhaps we should give it another try before sending you back to basic evaluation.
&10 我明白了……或许我们该再试一次，然后再把您送回基础评估。
&11 Excellent.  It appears that the memory-erasure did not tamper with that part of your brain too much.
&11 很好。看来记忆清除并没有太过损及您大脑的那部分。
&12 We will be moving on to another test.  This will be to determine if your lateral thinking skills are the same level as before.
&12 我们将进行另一项测试。这是为了判断您的横向思维能力是否还和从前处于同一水平。
&13 Please step up to the panel again.
&13 请再次走到操作台前。
B
B
C
C
Unlock
解锁
&14 Let's move onto something else in the meantime.
&14 我们先转到别的项目吧。
&15 Before your unfortunate escape attempt we were training you to wield a handgun.
&15 在您那次不幸的逃跑尝试之前，我们正训练您使用手枪。
&16 Let's see if you can still remember how to do it.
&16 看看您是否还记得怎么做。
&17 Go ahead.  Pick up the gun.
&17 来吧。拿起枪。
&18 Excellent. Seems like you won't have to redo basic training afterall.
&18 很好。看来您到底还是不必重做基础训练了。
&19 Let's move onto something else.
&19 我们换点别的吧。
&20 Excellent. Very good, Delta-Six, that will be all for today.
&20 很好。非常好，Delta-Six，今天就到这里。
To change the difficulty of combat, access the MENU, select OPTIONS and then click on COMBAT.
要更改战斗难度，请打开菜单，选择“选项”，然后点击“战斗”。
&21 Please place the gun back on the pedestal.
&21 请把枪放回底座。
&22 Press 'space' to fire.
&22 按“空格”开火。
&23 Remember, you can only reload from a covered position, not when aiming.
&23 记住，您只能在掩体内换弹，瞄准时不行。
&24 Good. Now try using up the rest of your ammo.
&24 好。现在把剩下的弹药打光。
0
0
&25 As you can see, you will run out of ammo quite steadily in the field.
&25 如您所见，实战中弹药会稳步消耗。
&26 Press 'R' to reload your weapon. Please note that you can only reload in the cover position.
&26 按“R”换弹。请注意，您只能在掩体内换弹。
&27 If this were a real scenario, you would be reloading with magazines.
&27 如果这是真实场景，您会用弹匣换弹。
&28 However, for this case just press the little lever on the side of the weapon and the chamber will refill.
&28 不过在这里，只需按下武器侧面的小拉杆，弹膛就会重新装满。
&29 Try shooting the target again after reloading.
&29 换弹后再试着射击目标。
&30 You might have noticed that shooting randomly, while hitting the target, often yields uneven results.
&30 您也许注意到了，胡乱射击就算击中目标，效果也往往参差不齐。
&31 If you wish to aim for a one-shot, one-kill head blow, you must concentrate before firing.
&31 若想打出一枪毙命的爆头，开火前必须凝神屏息。
&32 Try tapping 'CTRL' once to initiate a full breath.
&32 试着轻按一下“CTRL”，做一次完整的深呼吸。
&33 You are trying to score a headshot, not a body shot. Try again.
&33 您要打的是头部，不是躯干。再试一次。
&34 Very good.  But in the field your enemies will not remain stationary for you. They will also duck in and out of cover.
&34 很好。可实战中，敌人不会乖乖站着不动。他们也会忽进忽出地利用掩体。
&35 Try to score a head shot on the target while it moves in and out of position.
&35 趁目标进出掩体时，试着打出爆头。
&36 Now, didn't you have something else to finish?
&36 话说回来，您不是还有别的事没做完吗？
&37 Good.  Now let's move on to aiming.
&37 很好。现在，我们来练瞄准。
&38 Assume the out of cover position.
&38 摆出脱离掩体的姿势。
&39 When breathing in, there is a zone that will flash indicating you are set for a head shot.
&39 吸气时，会有一块区域闪烁，表示您已进入爆头的最佳时机。
&40 If you fire during this zone, you are guaranteed an instant kill.  However, this is only a small window of opportunity, and you must use it wisely.
&40 在这个区间开火，必定一击致命。可这机会稍纵即逝，您得用得聪明。
&41 Try it out on the target.
&41 拿目标试试。
&42 Good.  Now I suppose you don't remember why you are here anymore...
&42 很好。现在我猜，您已经不记得自己为什么在这里了……
&43 This is a training facility where you are taught to become proper citizens again.
&43 这里是训练设施，专教像您这样的人重新做回合格的公民。
&44 As long as you follow orders, you will be out of this facility and back on the road to a normal life.
&44 只要您服从命令，就能离开这里，重新走上正常生活的轨道。
&45 Now, you see that ticket that just came out of the wall?
&45 现在，看到刚从墙里吐出来的那张餐票了吗？
&46 These tickets are usually good for three meals.
&46 这种餐票通常能换三顿饭。
&47 You can redeem them at the mess hall by inserting them into a dispenser.
&47 您可以拿到食堂，把它插进发放机里兑换。
&48 Go ahead and take it. Your food and well-being is up to you to take care of.
&48 去吧，拿上它。您的饮食起居，都得您自己照料。
&89 ...yes...
&89 ……是……
&49 Thank you, Delta-Six.  Now, shall we get down to business?
&49 谢谢您，Delta-Six。那么，我们开始正事吧？
&50 Yes, I think we shall.
&50 是的，我看就这么办。
&51 So you see when we erase your memory again, sometimes, although it is a rare occurrence, other brain functions get reset besides the short and long term memory.
&51 您瞧，我们再次清除您的记忆时，偶尔——虽然极为罕见——除了长短期记忆，别的脑功能也会被一并重置。
&52 What we are going to do here is retest your cognitive abilities among other things.
&52 我们接下来要做的，就是重新测试您的认知能力，以及其他一些项目。
&53 Now would you kindly step up to the panel on the wall?
&53 现在，请您行行好，走到墙上那块面板前？
None of the buttons do anything.
这些按钮按了都没反应。
&54 Delta-Six, did I say you could play with that little toy yet?
&54 Delta-Six，我准您玩那个小玩具了吗？
The console doesn't respond.
控制台没有反应。
&55 Some of the other instructors were worried that we erased your cognitive functions along with your memory banks--it does occasionally happen--so they wanted you to retake some simple logic tests.
&55 有几位教官担心，我们清除您的记忆库时，把您的认知功能也一并抹掉了——这种事偶尔会发生——所以他们希望您重做几套简单的逻辑测试。
&56 But logic tests are such a bore, and you look fine to me. Don't you agree, Delta-Six?
&56 可逻辑测试无聊透顶，况且您在我看来好得很。您说是不是，Delta-Six？
&57 I'll take that as a yes...
&57 我就当您答应了……
&58 So let's get back to the fun bit of your training.
&58 那我们回到您训练里更有趣的那部分吧。
&59 Before your unfortunate escape attempt we were training you in the finer aspects of the handgun.
&59 在您那次不幸的越狱之前，我们正教您手枪更精细的用法。
&60 Go ahead.  Pick up your new toy.
&60 去吧，拿起您的新玩具。
&61 Oh, and Delta-Six--please don't try to escape again.
&61 哦，还有，Delta-Six——请别再想着逃跑了。
&62 Erasing your memory is just as painful for you as it is for us.
&62 清除您的记忆，对您和对我们，一样痛苦。
&63 We have a tight schedule here and we're on time limitations to get you and all of your friends rehabilitated.
&63 我们这里日程很紧，要在有限的时间里，让您和您所有的朋友完成康复。
&64 For all of our sakes, I hope I don't have to repeat myself again.
&64 为了大家好，我希望不必再重复第二遍。
&65 Do I make myself clear?
&65 我说明白了吗？
&66 Good, Delta-Six.  Now, please exit the testing chamber.
&66 很好，Delta-Six。现在，请离开测试舱。
A little ticket came out of the dispenser in the wall.
墙上的发放机吐出了一张小餐票。
That grate leads into a drain.
这道格栅通向一条排水沟。
It's screwed in place. I'll need some kind of tool if I want to remove it.
用螺丝拧死了。想拆下来，我得找件工具。
I can't do it while the camera is watching me.
摄像头盯着我，我做不了。
The keypad--It does nothing.
这键盘——毫无反应。
The contraption on the wall contains a keypad and a slot.
墙上那装置有一个键盘和一道插槽。
I'm powerless to open it.
我打不开它。
&67 You'll have to put the gun back in order for it to open.
