&840 从上面够不着他。
&841 His pockets are empty.
&841 他兜里是空的。
&842 I don't see anything on him.
&842 他身上没找到东西。
&843 Kicking him won't do anything.
&843 踢他也没用。
&844 I don't talk to my victims.
&844 我不跟自己的猎物说话。
&845 He's already dead...
&845 他已经死了……
&846 Nothing on this guy...
&846 这家伙身上什么都没有……
&847 He probably burned puppy orphanages.
&847 他八成烧过小狗孤儿院。
&848 I can't reach in his jacket. His whole body is pressing down on it.
&848 我伸不进他外套。整个身子都压在上面。
&849 I can't search his jacket as long as his body is is turned over.
&849 只要没把尸体翻过来，我就搜不了他的外套。
&850 I got his wallet...
&850 我拿到他的钱包了……
&851 Only thing that looks useful is his ID card...
&851 唯一有用的就是他的身份卡……
&852 There's nothing else on him.
&852 他身上没别的了。
&853 He's already turned over.
&853 我已经把他翻过来了。
&854 He was probably a juice dealer.
&854 他多半是个果汁贩子。
&855 I'm not going to sift through countless amounts of trash.
&855 我可不想翻遍这一堆垃圾。
&856 That didn't accomplish much.
&856 没什么收获。
&857 I can't reach it from up here.
&857 从上面够不着。
&858 Hmm... looks like a magazine of good ammo.
&858 嗯……像是满满一匣好弹药。
&859 I'll add it to the rest of my ammo stash.
&859 加进我剩下的弹药里。
&860 I should probably get out of here first.
&860 也许该先从这儿爬出去。
