&898 Ow!
&898 哎哟！
&899 It's short-circuiting.
&899 短路了。
&900 I can see the boxes in there, but I can't reach them.
&900 我看得见里面的箱子，可够不着。
&901 I can't quite get under the door.
&901 我钻不到门底下去。
&902 Maybe somebody smaller could get under there.
&902 也许个头小点的能钻进去。
