PRISONER ON THE LOOSE? [ Janury 25th, 2229 [[ Authorities from the Gemini police are reportedly looking for an escaped prisoner from an undisclosed location. All searches have turned up nothing. The government is giving out no information on the nature of the breakout or the prison. At this time, it remains unclear if the prisoner is still at large in the streets of Pittsburg.
囚犯在逃？ [ 2229年1月25日 [[ 据报，双子星警方正在搜捕一名从某未公开地点逃脱的囚犯。所有搜寻均一无所获。政府未就此次越狱的经过及该监狱透露任何信息。目前尚不清楚该囚犯是否仍逍遥于匹兹堡街头。
&998 A prisoner escaped from it and made their way here?
&998 有个囚犯从那儿逃出来，一路跑到了这里？
&999 I wonder if they're still around here...
&999 不知道那人还在不在附近……
&1000 Not now!
&1000 现在不行！
PRISONER ON THE LOOSE? [ Janury 25th, 2229 [[ Authorities from the Gemini police are reportedly looking for an escaped prisoner from an unknown prison entitled Center 7. All searches have turned up nothing. The government is giving out no information on this mysteriously titled compound known as 'Center 7.' At this time, it remains unclear if the prisoner is still at large in the streets of Pittsburg.
囚犯在逃？ [ 2229年1月25日 [[ 据报，双子星警方正在搜捕一名从名为“第七中心”的不明监狱逃脱的囚犯。所有搜寻均一无所获。政府未就这处名称神秘、被称作“第七中心”的设施透露任何信息。目前尚不清楚该囚犯是否仍逍遥于匹兹堡街头。
WEATHER TOWER TO BLAME[ July 8th, 2229 [[ The acid rain scare caused yesterday has been pinpointed to the malfunctioning Weather Tower 02. Engineers are taking the tower offline for repairs, and it is unknown whether the government will pass the bill to fund the costly repair project. In the meantime, there is no estimated date for the weather tower to go back online, leaving it dormant on the eastern edge of the valley.
罪魁祸首竟是气象塔[ 2229年7月8日 [[ 昨日引发恐慌的酸雨，已查明源于气象塔02故障。工程师正将其停机检修，而政府是否会通过法案为这项高昂的维修工程拨款，仍属未知。与此同时，气象塔恢复运转的日期尚无预估，只得停摆在山谷东缘。
ASSASSIN FIGHTS CRIME? [ August 12th, 2229 [[ Reports of an ex-assassin ratting out syndicates all over Taurus continue to pour into Gemini. This unknown vigilante has reportedly taken down over 3 syndicates and put hundreds of criminals in jail since his cooperation with the police force starting earlier this year. Citizens hoping for him taking down the Boryokudan stay in despair, however, as the peace treaty's measures prevent any Taurus police from entering this jurisdiciton.
杀手除暴安良？ [ 2229年8月12日 [[ 一名前杀手在金牛星系各地检举犯罪集团的消息，仍不断传入双子星系。据称，自今年初与警方合作以来，这名身份不明的义警已扳倒三个以上的犯罪集团，将数百名罪犯送进监狱。然而，指望他铲除暴力团的市民只能失望——和平条约的条款禁止任何金牛警方踏入本辖区。
