I remember when they used to just call this the Pittsburg Tribune.
我记得以前这报纸就叫《匹兹堡论坛报》。
  Recent talks by the Pittsburg Mayor has the now abandoned Weather Tower on the Eastern end of the city up for re-establishment. The plan proposed by an engineering council would upgrade the now disfunctional Weather Tower to the newer models on the other ends of the City. Using the new technology, the mining schedule would become more relaxed, a thing beneficial to all citizens of the city.
  匹兹堡市长近日提议，重新启用位于城市东端、现已废弃的气象塔。一个工程委员会提出的方案，将把这座失灵的气象塔升级至城市其他区域的新型标准。借助新技术，采矿日程将更为宽松，全市市民都将从中受益。
  According to the Barracus Police Chief, a shortage of the supply of the illegal drug known as 'juice' has caused some addicts to experience symptons of withdrawal, the most severe of which may result in death. Medical experts advise anyone who is suffering from symptons to seek out the nearest Medical Station available in their area, where they can receive medical help.
  据巴拉库斯警长称，非法药物“果汁”供应短缺，已使部分成瘾者出现戒断症状，严重者甚至可能致死。医学专家建议，凡出现症状者，应尽快前往就近的医疗站接受救治。
  Wednesday marks the tenth Anniversary of Gemini Independence from the Taurus Galaxy. A special ceremony will be held in Cleveland to commemorate the event. Since Indpendence, Gemini has contined to expand beyond Barracus and Harmony into other planets such as Colony 4.
  本周三是双子星系脱离金牛星系独立十周年。克利夫兰将举行特别仪式以资纪念。独立以来，双子星系不断向巴拉库斯和哈莫尼之外扩张，触及四号殖民地等其他行星。
