&33 我……通常……不喜欢和我的病人面对面交谈，不过……
&34 ...But it appears you have... made quite a mess of things.
&34 ……不过看来，您……着实把事情搞得一团糟。
&341 You think controlling our lives... is your decision...?
&341 你以为……操控我们的人生……该由你来决定……？
&35 My decision? ...If I don't do it, then society has already done it.
&35 由我决定？……就算我不插手，社会也早替每个人决定好了。
&36 Everything in a normal human being's life creates who that person is, from their environment, to their friends, to their life experiences.
&36 一个正常人的一生里，一切都在塑造他这个人——环境、朋友、人生经历。
&37 All I'm doing is re-creating that. It's the same thing that happens to every person who enters this world.
&37 我不过是把这一切重现一遍。每个来到这世上的人，经历的都是同一件事。
&38 No matter what, I can't control everything.
&38 无论如何，我也无法掌控一切。
&39 Do you still blame yourself for leaving Delta-Six behind?
&39 您还在为丢下Delta-Six自责吗？
&342 Are you going to kill me?
&342 你要杀了我吗？
&40 What do you think? Do I have a choice?
&40 您觉得呢？我有选择吗？
&41 Maybe everything in my life was predetermined to this moment.
&41 或许我这一生的一切，都早已注定通向此刻。
&42 Maybe someone chose my past, my life experiences, my environment.
&42 或许有人替我选好了我的过去、我的人生经历、我的环境。
&43 Maybe that shaped my personality into who I am and what I can and can't do.
&43 或许正是这些塑造了我的人格，决定了我是谁、能做什么、不能做什么。
&44 But here I am... with this gun...
&44 可我就站在这儿……握着这把枪……
&45 I don't have a choice, do I?
&45 我没有选择，对吗？
&46 What I am about to choose has already been decided by every programmed bit of my being before me...
&46 我即将做出的选择，早已由构成我的每一段程序预先决定好了……
&47 What is it then...?
&47 那么，会是什么呢……？
&48 Do you think I have a choice?
&48 您觉得我有选择吗？
