&177 Welcome to the rehabilitation center for--
&177 欢迎来到康复中心，本中心专为——
&158 Sadly, we've already wasted enough time, so... I don't have the time or nerve to listen to that automated tape again.
&158 可惜，我们已经浪费了太多时间，所以……我实在没时间，也没那个耐性，再听一遍那段自动录音。
