&161 Delta-Six.
&161 Delta-Six。
&162 Wake up, will you?
&162 醒醒，好吗？
&163 ...Thank you.
&163 ……谢谢。
&164 I really, really, don't understand why you have to put me in this... frustrating position to have to recondition you all over again.
&164 我真的、真的不明白，您为什么非要把我逼到这种……恼人的境地，让我不得不把您从头重塑一遍。
&165 Do you realize how far you've set back your training by trying to escape and having your memory wiped again?
&165 您可知道，就因为您试图逃跑、又被清除了一遍记忆，您的训练倒退了多少？
