&172 Please assume the cover position.
&172 请进入掩体位置。
&173 Now then, most often times in battle, instead of facing a single lone target, you will face multiple targets.
&173 那么，在实战中，您多数时候面对的不是单个目标，而是多个目标。
&174 Combat is carried out the same way as before, but you now have three different positions--two positions out of cover.
&174 战斗方式和之前一样，但您现在有三个位置——其中两个在掩体之外。
&175 You can press 'A' or 'D' to go out of cover either to your left, or your right.
&175 您可以按 'A' 或 'D' 向左或向右探出掩体。
&176 In addition, pressing 'S' will return you to your cover position from any out of cover spot.
&176 此外，无论您探身在哪一侧，按 'S' 都能返回掩体位置。
&177 Try going out of cover to your left, now.
&177 现在，试着向左探出掩体。
Press ESCAPE to exit the training segment.
按 ESCAPE 退出训练环节。
&178 10 hits on each target, and you will be rewarded your food ticket for today.
&178 每个目标各命中10次，您就能领到今天的餐票。
&179 Ready?
&179 准备好了吗？
&180 Begin.
&180 开始。
&181 Oh. It's you again.
&181 哦，又是您。
&182 I'll send up the gun if you want to practice.
&182 您想练习的话，我会把枪送上来。
&183 Excellent. Please place the gun back in the pedestal.
&183 很好。请把枪放回底座。
&184 You can fire at any target from any out of cover position by cycling between them with 'W'.  Try it out.
&184 在任何探身位置，您都可以按 'W' 在目标间切换，向任意目标开火。试试看。
&185 The key to fighting multiple targets is that your opponents usually fire only at the last spot they saw you.
&185 对付多个目标的关键在于：您的对手通常只朝最后一次看到您的位置开火。
&186 Knowing this, you can switch between cover positions to fire at enemies without waiting for them to go back into cover.
&186 明白这一点，您就能切换掩体位置向敌人开火，不必等他们退回掩体。
&187 Now then, we're going to try a little training exercise.
&187 那么，我们来做个小小的练习。
&188 You are going to have to hit each target for five points, while a simulated counter measure is carried out.
&188 您需要在每个目标上各打满五分，同时会有一套模拟反制措施在运行。
&189 Headshots are worth 2 points, body shots are worth 1 point.
&189 爆头得2分，躯干命中得1分。
&190 You see that light that just popped on?
&190 看到刚刚亮起的那道光了吗？
&191 That means that the enemy is currently firing on that side of your cover zone, so you will only want to attack from the other side.
&191 那表示敌人正朝您掩体的那一侧开火，所以您只应从另一侧进攻。
&192 I want you to hit each target for five points, without getting hit by the light.
&192 我要您在每个目标上各打满五分，同时不被那道光击中。
&193 Ready...?
&193 准备好了……？
&194 Alright then, Delta-Six, here we go again.
&194 好了，Delta-Six，我们再来一次。
&195 Now you know about the light already.
&195 现在您已经了解那道光了。
&191 That means that the enemy is currently firing on that side of your cover zone, so you will only want toattack from the other side.
&191 那表示敌人正朝您掩体的那一侧开火，所以您只应从另一侧进攻。
&196 Five hits, each target.
&196 每个目标各命中五次。
&197 Nicely done, Delta-Six. Good work.
&197 做得漂亮，Delta-Six。很好。
&198 Now, you may take a break if you wish, but if you want to begin the real test for your food ticket, replace the gun and have at it again.
&198 现在您若想休息，尽管休息；但若要开始正式测试、赢取餐票，就把枪放回去，再来一次。
&199 Ten hits, each target.
&199 每个目标各命中十次。
&200 Excellent work, Delta-Six.
&200 做得非常出色，Delta-Six。
&201 Of course, I don't expect you to instinctively learn this at once, so you can practice this section as much as you'd like throughout today's routine.
&201 当然，我并不指望您一次就本能地掌握，所以今天的日程内，这一节您想练多少遍都行。
&202 If you are done with the firing range, please replace the pistol on the pedestal.
&202 如果您在靶场练完了，请把手枪放回底座。
&203 Don't forget your food ticket on the way out. You've earned it.
&203 出去时别忘了您的餐票。这是您应得的。
&204 Alright. So you've felt the simulated shock.
&204 好了。您已经尝到模拟电击的滋味了。
&205 Your enemies will adapt to which side you are on if you linger there for too long.
&205 如果您在一侧逗留太久，敌人就会适应您所在的位置。
&206 Taking this in mind, you'll want to pop out for several quick shots and then pop back in to cover.
&206 记住这一点，您应该探身打几枪，然后立刻缩回掩体。
&207 As long as you do not remain out of cover for too long, your enemies will not always be able to re-aim at you quickly enough.
&207 只要您探身的时间不长，敌人未必总能及时重新瞄准您。
&208 But as I said earlier, that's your first strike.
&208 但正如我先前所说，这是您第一次被击中。
&209 If you get three strikes, we'll start the training exercise over.
&209 若您被击中三次，我们就从头开始这次训练。
&210 Have at it again.
&210 再试一次。
&211 Strike one.
&211 第一次被击中。
&212 Strike two. One more and it's over.
&212 第二次被击中。再中一次就结束了。
&213 Strike three, Delta-Six.
&213 第三次被击中，Delta-Six。
&214 You'll have to replace the gun if you want to retry the testing.
&214 您若想重新测试，就得把枪放回去。
&215 I'm sure this must all be a little overwhelming for you, so I'll let you take a break.
&215 我想，这一切对您来说难免有些吃不消，那就歇一会儿吧。
&216 Just come back when you're ready.
&216 准备好了就回来。
&217 Taking this in mind, you'll only want to pop out for a quick one or two shots and then pop back in to cover.
&217 记住这一点，您只该探身打一两枪，然后立刻缩回掩体。
&218 Delta-Six: I hope this will be the first and only time I have to teach you this stage of your training.
&218 Delta-Six：我希望这是我第一次、也是唯一一次教您这一阶段的训练。
&219 Alright... Let's get down to business.
&219 好了……我们言归正传。
&220 Today we will continue with your gun training.
&220 今天我们继续您的枪械训练。
&221 These tests may take awhile to complete and may require some practice, so you will be free to leave this segment and come back if you cannot immediately complete them.
&221 这些测试或许需要些时间和练习才能完成，所以若您一时通不过，尽可离开这一环节，稍后再来。
