&228 别担心，回去把它放回底座就行。
I've gotten the grate off. The drain plummets down at least five feet into darkness.
我把格栅卸下来了。排水口往下至少五英尺，一片漆黑。
It's too blunt to use on the grate.
太钝了，对付不了格栅。
That won't get it open.
那样打不开。
I can't get it in there while the grate is on.
格栅还在，我塞不进去。
I could try shooting the grate, but I doubt it would work.
我可以试着朝格栅开枪，但多半没用。
It didn't do anything to the grate.
格栅纹丝不动。
There's nothing for me to do in the drain. It's wiped clean.
排水口里没什么好弄的。里面冲得干干净净。
I can't reach the pistol, let alone see it down there.
我够不着手枪，更别说看见它。
The only thing I could do with my foot is get it stuck down there.
拿脚去够，只会卡在里面。
That drain must go down to a lower level.
这排水口一定通到下一层。
The lid is already screwed off.
盖子已经拧下来了。
Dropping that down it is pointless.
把那个扔下去没意义。
I dropped it into the grate.
我把它丢进了格栅。
