&3 *咣当*
I think it's stuck somewhere down there.
大概卡在下面什么地方了。
Maybe there's some way I can find it on the lower levels.
也许在下面的楼层能找到它。
I'd better make sure the door is open first, otherwise I might be stuck in here.
最好先确认门开着，不然我会困在这儿。
My hand doesn't do anything to it. It needs something on it to go down.
手推不动。得在上面压点东西，它才会降下去。
I should take the gun first.
我应该先拿枪。
That won't help here.
在这儿没用。
