&71 你跟我说，你打算再让他们清除一次你的记忆。有人想逃，他们就会这么做。
&72 You said it was to complete a map. To find out where we are.
&72 你说是为了补全一张地图。为了弄清我们在哪儿。
&114 Why?
&114 为什么？
&73 Because... we have to get out of here... before the director...
&73 因为……我们必须离开这里……趁院长还没……
&74 I know you don't remember anything... but... you have to trust me.
&74 我知道你什么都不记得了……可是……你必须相信我。
&75 You took care of me when I got here, and now it's my turn to take care of you.
&75 我刚来的时候是你照顾我，现在轮到我照顾你了。
&76 Please... try to remember.
&76 求你……试着想起来。
&115 I don't... sorry...
&115 我想不起……对不起……
&77 Here... have the rest of my food.
&77 给……我剩下的你吃吧。
&78 I'll meet you tomorrow at my testing chamber. We... we usually walk back together.
&78 明天在我的测试舱见。我们……我们通常一起走回去。
&79 Okay?
&79 好吗？
&80 Remember, whatever you do, don't complete your final exam. Don't.
&80 记住，无论如何，别通过期末考核。千万别。
I've finished all the food I could.
我能吃的都吃完了。
&76 Charlie, good to see ya, buddy.
&76 查理，见到你真好，伙计。
&77 Oh... you don't remember me, do you?
&77 哦……你不记得我了，是吧？
&78 I told you not to go through with it, man. I told you not to do it.
&78 我早跟你说过别干这事，伙计。我说过别那么干。
&116 ...Who are you?
&116 ……你是谁？
&79 I'm Balder.
&79 我是巴尔德。
&80 Somebody stole your food ticket, huh?
&80 你的餐票被人偷了，是吧？
&81 Don't worry, you can have the rest of mine.
&81 别担心，我剩下的你拿去吃。
&82 We're friends, Charlie. We've stuck together since day one.
&82 我们是朋友，查理。从第一天起就一直在一块儿。
&83 Have you talked to anyone else yet?
&83 你跟别人聊过了吗？
&81 Hi, Charlie.
&81 嗨，查理。
&117 Hello.
&117 你好。
&82 I think it's safe to talk right now.
&82 现在应该可以说话了。
&83 Where's your food?
&83 你的饭呢？
&118 I... don't have a ticket.
&118 我……没有餐票。
&84 What happened?
&84 怎么了？
&119 Someone... stole it from me.
&119 有人……把它偷走了。
&85 ...Oh.
&85 ……哦。
&86 Don't worry. That's... normal.
&86 别担心。这……很正常。
&87 What do you remember?
&87 你还记得什么？
&120 Nothing.
&120 什么都不记得。
&88 You-you got here before me. If-if it wasn't for you, I don't know what I would've done.
&88 你、你比我先到这儿。要、要不是你，我真不知道自己会怎么样。
&141 Charlie... Epsilon-Five...
&141 查理……Epsilon-Five……
&121 You wanted to see me?
&121 你找我？
&142 Sit down.
&142 坐下。
&143 Epsilon-Five will be coming with us after all.
&143 Epsilon-Five还是跟我们一起走。
&144 Everything's ready.  I got the map completed.  Except Balder won't be coming with us.
&144 都准备好了。地图我弄完了。只是巴尔德不跟我们走了。
&89 Why?
&89 为什么？
&145 He had some kind of accident on maintenance duty last night.  A steam valve wrecked his face or something.
&145 昨晚他在维护值班时出了事故。好像是蒸汽阀门毁了他的脸。
&146 They said some doctors came in while nobody knew and took him to one of the other floors.
&146 听说有医生趁没人注意进来，把他带去了别的楼层。
&147 ...Anyway... I guess we'll have to leave without him if he doesn't show up.
&147 ……总之……他要是不出现，我们只能丢下他走了。
&122 How are we doing this?
&122 我们要怎么做？
&148 Judging by the map, we should exit from Maintenance Level 1-A, disable the security--that's you Epsilon--then try to reach the cargo bay.
&148 从地图看，我们应该从维护层1-A出去，关掉安保系统——那是你的活儿，Epsilon——然后设法到货舱去。
&149 Turns out your computer skills are useful for something.
&149 看来你的电脑本事总算派上用场了。
&150 That appears to be the only way off this place since we seem to be in outer space.
&150 我们八成是在外太空，那大概是离开这儿的唯一办法。
&151 It looks like they have computer labs here... and here.
&151 看样子他们的电脑实验室在这儿……还有这儿。
&152 If they have our old memories, that's where they'll be, and that's where we'll go.
&152 要是他们存着我们的旧记忆，就在那儿。我们就去那儿。
&153 Once one of us gets maintenance duty, we're all going to regroup on the maintenance floor.
&153 只要有人被派去维护值班，大家就在维护层集合。
&90 What'll happen if we get caught?
&90 要是被抓住会怎么样？
&154 Same thing that happens to everyone.
&154 跟所有人一个下场。
&123 We won't remember this conversation.
&123 我们不会记得这次谈话。
&155 Until that maintenance call comes... just stay tight.
&155 在维护调令下来之前……都给我沉住气。
&156 Say, Charlie... you wanna go check your stash one more time, just in case you left anything from your past life?
&156 我说，查理……要不要再去翻翻你的藏匿处，说不定还留着你过去生活的什么东西？
&157 I mean, it's not like you have anything better to do.
&157 反正你也没别的事可做。
I should check my stash now.
我该去看看藏匿处了。
I got it off.
弄下来了。
I don't want to sit there.
我不想坐那儿。
There's no food there.
那儿没吃的。
&84 Don't say anything.
&84 什么都别说。
&85 They're watching us.
&85 他们在盯着我们。
&86 Okay, I'll try to say this quick. Your name is Charlie. I'm Balder.
&86 好，我尽量长话短说。你叫查理。我是巴尔德。
&124 I thought my name was-
&124 我以为我叫——
&87 Keep your voice down.
&87 小声点。
&88 If you really want to be called, Delta-Six, then fine. I wasn't the one who wanted to be called Charlie.
&88 你要是真想让人叫你Delta-Six，那随你。想叫你查理的可不是我。
&89 You tried to escape the other day. They erase the memories of those who try, but none of us have our old memories anyway.
&89 前几天你想逃。谁想逃，他们就清谁的记忆。反正我们谁也没有旧记忆。
&90 What, are you mute now?
&90 怎么，成哑巴了？
&125 ...No...
&125 ……不……
&91 You may not remember this, but there's a girl around here called Epsilon-Five.
&91 你可能不记得了，不过这附近有个女孩，叫Epsilon-Five。
&92 She's not your friend.  It's because of her that everyone hates you.
&92 她不是你的朋友。就是因为她，大家都恨你。
&93 Now that she knows your memory is erased, she may try to take advantage of that.
&93 现在她知道你的记忆被清了，可能会趁机利用你。
&94 If she pretends to know you, don't believe her.
&94 要是她装作认识你，别信她。
&126 Who...
&126 谁……
&95 Here, take the rest of my food.
&95 给，我剩下的你拿去吃。
The food is tasteless, but nourishing.
吃的没味道，但有营养。
&96 If we talk any longer, they'll notice us.
&96 再说下去，他们会发现的。
&97 I'll try to explain everything tomorrow.
&97 明天我尽量把一切都解释给你听。
&91 Charlie...?
&91 查理……？
&92 I... It's me, Charlie.
&92 我……是我啊，查理。
&93 I'm your friend... Epsilon-Five.
&93 我是你的朋友……Epsilon-Five。
&94 Why were you sitting with Balder? Don't you remember what he did to me?
&94 你怎么跟巴尔德坐在一起？你忘了他对我做过什么？
&95 I don't want to attract attention to us.
&95 我不想让人注意到我们。
&96 I'll explain everything tomorrow.
&96 明天我把一切都解释给你听。
I don't need to sit down again.
我不用再坐下了。
