&1 Hey. You.
&1 喂。你。
&2 Wake up. You in the other cell.
&2 醒醒。隔壁牢房那个。
&131 What? Who are you?
&131 什么？你是谁？
&3 I'm the voice inside your head, who else?
&3 你脑子里的声音，还能是谁？
&132 What do you want?
&132 你想干什么？
&4 You tried to escape the other day, didn't ya, Delta-Six?
&4 前几天你想逃，对吧，Delta-Six？
&5 Now you have no idea who you are anymore, but then again, you didn't before so it doesn't matter.
&5 现在你又不知道自己是谁了。不过反正你以前也不知道，无所谓。
&6 You've never seen them, our captors, have you?
&6 你从没见过他们吧？关着我们的那些人。
&7 I think it's because they're afraid of us. They never show their faces.
&7 我猜他们是怕我们。从不露脸。
&8 They want to catch you when you're vulnerable. It's because they fear you.
&8 他们专挑你没防备的时候下手。就因为怕你。
&9 Then you know what they'll do? They just erase your memory again.
&9 然后你猜他们会怎么做？再把你的记忆清除一遍。
&10 They keep doing it, over, and over, and over.
&10 他们就这么干，一遍，一遍，又一遍。
&11 It could make a guy crazy, you know?!
&11 这能把人逼疯，你知道吗？！
&12 I can speak from experience, after all.
&12 毕竟，我是过来人。
&13 Just to warn you, that's all. I'll be out of here soon enough.
&13 就是提醒你一句，仅此而已。反正我很快就出去了。
&14 I'm tired of trying to escape over and over. It's not worth it.
&14 我受够了一次次逃跑。不值得。
&15 I'm completing my final exam today, and then I get to leave this place.
&15 我今天就把期末考核过了，然后就能离开这地方了。
&133 You get to leave?
&133 你……能离开？
&16 And you will too. As long as you follow orders.
&16 你也一样。只要你服从命令。
&17 Oh man. I think they heard me. Go back to bed, quick.
&17 糟了。他们好像听见我了。快回床上去。
&18 The system is resetting for the day.
&18 系统正在重置，新的一天开始了。
&7 Good morning, Delta-Six.
&7 早上好，Delta-Six。
&8 I was instructed to refresh your memory in our daily operations.
&8 我奉命帮您重温一遍这里的日常流程。
&9 All floors will be open to you for most of the day except maintenance.
&9 一天中的大部分时间，除维护层外，所有楼层都对您开放。
&10 You will only go there when assigned maintenance duty.
&10 只有被分配到维护任务时，您才会去那里。
&11 If you are called for maintenance duty, we will page you and give you the card to unlock the maintenance door.
&11 如果轮到您执行维护任务，我们会呼叫您，并交给您开启维护门的门卡。
&12 Throughout the day, you have scheduled tests that you must complete.
&12 一天当中，您必须完成安排好的测试。
&13 Once you pass the final test, you will be granted leave from this facility and be renewed as a citizen of this galaxy.
&13 一旦通过最终测试，您便获准离开本机构，作为本星系公民换发新生。
&14 There will be three meals served each day.
&14 每天供应三餐。
&15 Meals are redeemable only through the use of the food tickets you are rewarded after completing your tests.
&15 用餐一律凭餐票兑换。餐票是您完成测试后的奖励。
&16 Please report to the mess hall for breakfast, and to the testing chambers after that.
&16 请前往食堂用早餐，随后前往测试舱。
&17 You will be testing in BLU-Chamber 2 today.
&17 您今天将在BLU-2号舱进行测试。
&18 You have (3) tests remaining until the final exam.
&18 距离期末考核，您还剩(3)项测试。
&19 Once again, report to the mess hall for breakfast and then to BLU-Chamber 2. End of message.
&19 重复一遍：请前往食堂用早餐，随后前往BLU-2号舱。消息结束。
