The steam is making the metal too hot. I'll have to stop it somehow.
蒸汽把金属烤得太烫。我得想办法关掉它。
I have the gun with me right here. I need to finish what I started.
枪就在我身上。开了头，就得做完。
It's time to get out of here.
该离开这儿了。
&161 Hey there, Charlie.
&161 嘿，查理。
&162 Since you're here, I thought maybe you could help me with something.
&162 既然你来了，我想你或许能帮我个忙。
&143 ...What's that?
&143 ……什么事？
&163 I was trying to finish my maintenance shift when I realized I needed to reset the air shafts from LVL 2 to here.
&163 我本想把维护班干完，才发现得把通风井从2层重置到这儿。
&144 You want me to fix it?
&144 你想让我来修？
&164 Well, if you insist.
&164 行啊，既然你自告奋勇。
&165 If you want to try, you can use this machine down here.
&165 想试的话，用下面这台机器。
&145 What about the camera?
&145 那摄像头呢？
&166 You really think somebody's watching us?
&166 你真以为有人在盯着我们？
&167 If you're really that paranoid, fine, stay up there, I don't care.
&167 你要是真那么疑神疑鬼，行，待在上面，我无所谓。
&168 Sayuri, take that camera down.
&168 纱由里，把那个摄像头关掉。
&113 I think it's down.
&113 应该关了。
&169 Hmm...
&169 嗯……
&170 Wonder what happened in here...
&170 这儿到底出过什么事……
&171 The whole place is in shambles.
&171 这地方一片狼藉。
&172 Anyway, that's going to be our exit point.
&172 总之，那儿就是我们的出口。
&173 I have an access code that should disable the security without being detected.
&173 我有个访问码，能关掉安保系统，不会被发现。
&258 Apparently some pipes busted and the air fluctuation system was damaged.
&258 看来是有管道爆裂，气流调节系统受损了。
&259 We need you to reset the system and fix any damage you see or else a lot of people will be suffocating.
&259 需要你重置系统，修复所见的一切损坏，否则会有很多人窒息。
&288 Push the reset button on the console down there once you're done.
&288 完成后，按下面控制台上的重置按钮。
&260 Work quickly and safely.
&260 请迅速、安全地作业。
&174 What do you think you're doing?
&174 你这是干什么？
&175 Did I say you could take that?
&175 我说了你能拿吗？
&176 Well you can't.
&176 你不能拿。
&177 I said you can't have it.
&177 我说了不能给你。
&146 But I need it.
&146 可我需要它。
&147 Can't we make a trade?
&147 我们能不能做个交易？
&178 Alright...
&178 好吧……
&179 Get me something to eat.
&179 给我弄点吃的。
&180 And I don't want one of those delta or beta meals, I want a gamma meal.
&180 我不要那种delta餐或者beta餐，我要gamma餐。
&181 Understand?
&181 明白吗？
&148 Yes...
&148 嗯……
&149 Meal... right...
&149 吃的……好……
I'll need to get off the box first.
我得先从箱子上下来。
I don't know what to do.
我不知道该怎么做。
I've already reset the drain pipes.
我已经重置过排水管了。
&261 Just turn on all the shafts (one through ten) and flip the power back on.
&261 只要把所有通风井（1到10号）都打开，再合上电源就行。
&262 You'll know if they're on when they turn green.
&262 变绿就说明开了。
I need to get closer.
我得靠近点。
I've already reset it.
我已经重置过了。
The machine can do nothing for me now.
这机器现在帮不了我了。
The machine is offline.
这台机器离线了。
&104 You know Charlie... I remember when you first got here.
&104 你知道吗，查理……我还记得你刚来那会儿。
&105 Just another Delta. Just another guy who would keep to himself.
&105 又一个Delta。又一个只想独来独往的家伙。
&106 Not you, though. You had to mess everything up.
&106 可你偏不。你非得把一切都搞砸。
&107 You... you are crazy.
&107 你……你疯了。
&108 You are a very crazy man.
&108 你是个十足的疯子。
&109 You... don't know what I'm going to do with you.
&109 你……根本不知道我会怎么收拾你。
&110 When I am finished with you, Epsilon-Five will be next.
&110 等我收拾完你，下一个就轮到 Epsilon-Five。
&111 She's a good little girl.
&111 她可是个乖巧的小姑娘。
&112 ...Follows you around all day ever since you got here.
&112 ……自打你来这儿，她就整天跟在你屁股后头。
&113 Just because you saved her. Once. She's your pet now.
&113 就因为你救过她。一次。现在她成了你的宠物。
&114 I don't know how you do it, Charlie.
&114 真不知道你是怎么办到的，查理。
&115 You just love getting your memory erased, don't you?
&115 你就是喜欢让人清你的记忆，对吧？
&116 I love it too, you know. It's very fun and gratifying.
&116 我也喜欢，你知道吗。有意思，还过瘾。
&117 Well guess what? I'm going to escape without you, using YOUR map.
&117 你猜怎么着？我要抛下你逃出去——用的还是你那张地图。
&118 Giselle told me everything. We're leaving within the next week or so.
&118 吉赛尔全告诉我了。我们下周左右就走。
&119 ...Without you.
&119 ……不带你。
&120 I might take Epsilon-Five with me. Get her memory erased too.
&120 说不定我会带上 Epsilon-Five。把她的记忆也一并清了。
&121 Then I can make you her enemy and me her friend.
&121 这样我就能让她把你当仇人，把我当朋友。
&122 You'd like that, wouldn't you?
&122 你肯定乐意，是不是？
&123 Argh... this is tiresome.
&123 啊……真烦人。
&124 What should I do with you Charlie....
&124 该拿你怎么办呢，查理……
&125 What should I do...
&125 该怎么办呢……
&126 I could kill you now, or I could leave you here to rot.
&126 我可以现在就杀了你，也可以把你扔在这儿烂掉。
&127 Or....
&127 或者……
&128 The possibilities are endless...
&128 花样多着呢……
&129 ...I could....
&129 ……我可以……
&130 ...Or maybe....
&130 ……又或者……
&131 ...No, that wouldn't work...
&131 ……不，那样行不通……
&132 ...Not this again...
&132 ……又来这套……
&123 Aiyah... this is tiresome.
&123 哎呀……真烦人。
&190 Unauthorized access point breached: Maintenance Level 1: Room 3.
&190 出入口遭未授权突破：维护层1：3号房间。
&167 Locking all access doors.
&167 正在锁闭所有出入口。
&168 Make no attempt to escape.
&168 不得试图逃跑。
&114 ...Giselle?
&114 ……吉赛尔？
&169 You have violated your rights as an inmate of this center.
&169 您已违反身为本中心收容者的各项权利。
&115 Giselle... what do we do...
&115 吉赛尔……我们该怎么办……
&263 Delta-Six, Epsilon-Five, Beta-Seven... the other instructors and I are truly, truly, disappointed in you all.
&263 Delta-Six、Epsilon-Five、Beta-Seven……我和其他教官，对各位非常、非常失望。
&218 Shut up.
&218 闭嘴。
&264 ...Please don't speak to me like that.
&264 ……请别用这种口气跟我说话。
&182 Why don't you come down here and face us, for once.
&182 你怎么不下来，当面跟我们对上一次？
&265 Giselle... I see you're still the same even after your rehabilitation.
&265 吉赛尔……看来即便做过康复治疗，您还是老样子。
&183 ...What?
&183 ……什么？
&266 What.... did I tell you, Delta-Six, about escaping?
&266 关于逃跑……我是怎么跟您说的，Delta-Six？
&267 Do you realize the trouble you've caused us?
&267 您知道自己给我们惹了多大麻烦吗？
&268 All of you, by requiring me to reteach you after I erase your memories again?
&268 还有各位——非要我把各位的记忆再清一次，然后从头重教一遍？
&269 I'm going to have to retrain you all again.
&269 我又得把各位统统再训练一遍。
&270 ...Just as soon as the guards come.
&270 ……只等守卫一到。
&271 They've locked down the maintenance level. They'll be here any second.
&271 他们已经封锁了维护层。守卫随时就到。
Function: pressing ESCAPE to skip walking is now DISABLED.
功能：按 ESCAPE 键跳过行走，现已禁用。
&272 Sometimes I wonder why you want to escape... to live with no identity. I could never understand that.
&272 有时我真不明白，各位为什么要逃……逃去过没有身份的日子。这一点我永远无法理解。
&273 We were going to give you a new life. A new identity. One that will let you be free from all your past troubles.
&273 我们本要给各位新的人生。新的身份。一个能摆脱过往一切烦恼的身份。
&274 Instead you're going to throw it all away. Why would you do that? Why?
&274 可各位偏偏要把这一切全扔掉。为什么要这样？为什么？
&275 You had your whole lives ahead of you.
&275 各位本来还有大好的一生。
&276 I wanted to give you a past--a past that you could live with.
&276 我想给各位一段过去——一段能坦然面对的过去。
&184 Shut up...
&184 闭嘴……
&277 Memories. Family. Friends. Things you can hold on to. Things that you would give up your entire lives for.
&277 记忆。家人。朋友。可以依靠的东西。值得拿一辈子去换的东西。
&185 I said SHUT UP.
&185 我说了，给我闭嘴。
&278 You don't know what it is to have a connection in this world, do you? To love someone and know that you are acknowledged alongside them?
&278 各位不懂在这世上与人有牵绊是什么滋味，是不是？爱一个人，也知道自己被他认可、与他相依？
&186 SHUT UP!
&186 闭嘴！
&279 Please close the door on your way out and reset the mainframe cooling.
&279 出去时请把门带上，再把主机冷却重置一下。
