&134 我的眼睛！
&135 AGH! I CAN'T SEE!
&135 啊！我看不见了！
&150 I'm... sorry...
&150 我……对不起……
&136 Charlie...
&136 查理……
&137 That's a nice name, you know that?
&137 这名字真好听，你知道吗？
&138 I... I wish I had a name like Charlie...
&138 我……我也想有个像查理这样的名字……
&139 I didn't get one though.
&139 可我没这福气。
&140 I got 'Balder' instead.
&140 我摊上的是“巴尔德”。
&141 They don't like me, Charlie...
&141 他们不喜欢我，查理……
&142 Nobody... talks to me anymore.
&142 没人……再跟我说话了。
&143 ...They... they treat me... like... like I'm a freak.
&143 ……他们……他们把我……当成……当成怪物。
&144 I wasn't going to hurt her, honest.
&144 我没想伤害她，真的。
&145 You-you don't even remember what I'm talking about, do you?
&145 你、你根本不记得我在说什么了吧？
&146 You ruined everything for me.
&146 你毁了我的一切。
&147 I used to be a somebody before you came along.
&147 你来之前，我好歹是个人物。
&148 But now... it's my turn.
&148 可现在……轮到我了。
&149 You're going to pay for what you've done to me.
&149 你对我做过的事，你会付出代价的。
&150 Time to die, Charlie.
&150 送你上路，查理。
&151 How does it feel?
&151 什么感觉？
&152 How does it feel to know that you were suckered since the day I got here?
&152 打我来这儿那天起，你就一直被我耍着玩——知道这个，什么感觉？
&153 You don't even remember what you did to me.
&153 你根本不记得自己对我做过什么。
&154 People were afraid of me... I could get whatever I wanted.
&154 以前人人都怕我……我想要什么就有什么。
&155 You HUMILIATED me in front of everyone.
&155 你当着所有人的面狠狠羞辱了我。
&156 Charlie, Charlie, Charlie...
&156 查理，查理，查理……
&157 What did you do to deserve this...
&157 你到底做了什么，才落得这下场……
&151 I've got to get out of here somehow...
&151 我得想办法离开这儿……
&187 I'm trying to reset the ventilation system from level 2 to level 1, which is here.
&187 我在想办法把通风系统从2层重设到1层，也就是这儿。
&188 To do this, you'll need to clear out the entire stretch of piping from here to the second level.
&188 要做到这点，你得把这儿到2层的整段管道全部打通。
&189 This stretch would effectively be shaft #3 to shaft #10.
&189 这一段其实就是#3到#10号风道。
&190 The power influx is low right now, so you can only open up to 5 shafts at a time once you reactivate the ventilation system.
&190 现在供电不足，重启通风系统后，一次最多只能打开5个风道。
&191 When you turn on shafts, they turn green, and also turn on any adjacent shafts.
&191 打开一个风道，它会变绿，相邻的风道也会跟着打开。
&192 So... there's only enough power to activate 5 shafts right now to clear the system from shaft # 3 to shaft # 10, so choose wisely.
&192 所以……现在的电力只够启动5个风道，而你得把#3到#10号风道全部打通——想清楚再选。
&193 ...Have fun...
&193 ……好好玩吧……
&194 I have no idea how you did that, but good job.
&194 我不知道你是怎么做到的，不过干得漂亮。
&152 Am I in now?
&152 那我现在算加入了吗？
&195 Yes.  Yes, you are.
&195 对。对，你加入了。
&153 When are we escaping?
&153 我们什么时候逃？
&196 I don't know yet. I'll have to set things up and build up our stashes.
&196 还不知道。我得先做好准备，把咱们的藏货攒够。
&154 Where are we going to escape to if we don't know where we are?
&154 我们连自己在哪都不知道，能逃到哪去？
&197 Look at this.
&197 看这个。
&198 This is the map you made when you broke out.
&198 这是你上次越狱时画的地图。
&199 You wrote a note down here.
&199 你在这下面写了点东西。
&200 I don't know what it says, because your hand writing is god-awful.
&200 我看不懂写的什么，你的字烂得要命。
&155 It says space-cargo bay.
&155 上面写的是“太空货舱”。
&201 So you're telling me we're in space?
&201 你是说我们在太空里？
&156 I don't know.  I didn't see it.
&156 不知道。我没亲眼见过。
&202 Either way, we have to finish this map before we plan the escape and also we need to get our stashes together.
&202 不管怎样，我们得先把这张地图画完才能计划逃跑，还得把藏货凑齐。
&203 Until then, don't pass your final exam unless you want your brain wiped again.
&203 在那之前别通过期末考核——除非你想再被清除一次记忆。
I'll have to get off the box first.
我得先从箱子上下来。
My hands can't reach that right here.
我的手从这儿够不着。
He's moving too fast. I can't time it unless he's not moving.
他动得太快。除非他停下来，否则我抓不准时机。
He's not in the right spot.
他没站对位置。
&158 What are you doing over there?
&158 你在那边干什么？
&159 What's going on over there?
&159 那边怎么回事？
&160 Don't try anything funny now.
&160 别给我耍花样。
&161 Hey. What are you doing?
&161 喂。你在干什么？
&162 What do you think you're doing?
&162 你搞什么鬼？
I can't do it while he's watching...
他盯着呢，我做不了……
I'm too short too reach it.
我太矮了，够不着。
I'm not quite under it.
我还没站到正下方。
It's still out of reach.
还是够不着。
The grate must lead to some pipe or shaft of some sort.
这道格栅后面肯定连着什么管道或风道。
Wait a second... I think I can see a gun in there.
等等……我好像看见里面有把枪。
I'm too far away.
我离得太远了。
Nothing. Still can't reach it. I'll have to use something longer.
没反应。还是够不着，得找根更长的东西。
&157 I can reach it, but there's no point in opening it right now.
&157 我够得着，但现在没必要打开它。
I don't think that can reach it.
我觉得那个够不着。
&285 Delta-Six, did I say you could leave just yet?
&285 Delta-Six，我准您走了吗？
&286 Make sure the air ventilation system is reset...
&286 请确保通风系统已重置……
&287 ...and the piping is replaced.
&287 ……管道也已更换。
I'll have to get past Balder first.
我得先绕过巴尔德。
It's locked.
锁上了。
&204 Don't touch my stuff.
&204 别碰我的东西。
&158 But I might need something in there.
&158 可里面也许有我用得上的东西。
&205 Don't you have anything left in your stash?
&205 你的藏货里就没剩点东西了？
&159 My what?
&159 我的什么？
&206 Your stash.
&206 你的藏货。
&300 What stash?
&300 什么藏货？
&207 Your toilet? Hello?
&207 你马桶里那些啊。喂，醒醒？
&301 I don't think so?
&301 大概……没有吧？
&208 Get me something to eat, and I'll open it.
&208 给我弄点吃的，我就打开。
