&209 我说了别碰。
I'll need to get closer.
我得靠近点。
I don't want it to lock on itself.
我不想让它自己锁死。
Maybe I'm not doing this the right way...
也许我的方法不对……
I need to be closer.
我得再近点。
Some tools and supplies.
一些工具和补给。
There's nothing in there that looks immediately useful.
里面没什么眼下用得上的东西。
A wrench...
一把扳手……
And two replacement pipes...
还有两根备用管子……
&290 Apologies, Delta-Six, but we don't have anything larger than 10 inch pipe replacements in stock.
&290 很抱歉，Delta-Six，我们库存里没有比10英寸更大的备用管道了。
&291 Please just fix the other pipes and reset the air system.
&291 请您修好其余的管道，重置通风系统。
