&302 剩下的都是没用的破烂。
This screwdriver should prove useful.
这把螺丝刀应该能派上用场。
There's nothing else useful in there.
里面没别的有用的了。
&303 No point in doing that.
&303 没必要那么做。
I unscrewed it.
拧松了。
It's already loose.
已经松了。
It is now screwed firmly in place.
已经拧紧了。
I should turn the steam back on to make sure the pipes work.
该重新打开蒸汽，确认管子没问题。
I just fixed it. I don't want to take it back out.
刚修好，不想再拆下来。
I'll have to remove the old pipe first.
得先拆掉旧管子。
It's already been replaced.
已经换好了。
It's screwed in place.
已经拧上了。
I got rid of the old pipe.
旧管子拆下来了。
I can't walk through that. I'd get burned.
我没法从那儿过去。会被烫伤。
&293 Make sure to test the steam after you replace both pipes.
&293 两根管子都换好后，请务必测试蒸汽。
There's nothing there. I need to put the pipe there.
那儿什么都没有。得把管子装上去。
There's a keypad here but I don't know the code.
有个密码键盘，可我不知道密码。
I can't do that while I'm tied up.
被绑着，做不了。
I could make a break for it, but it's probably locked.
我可以冲出去，但门大概锁着。
Enter Code
输入密码
Not budging.
纹丝不动。
That would probably set off an alarm.
那样大概会触发警报。
The door is too strong for that.
这门太结实，那样没用。
I need to get off the box first.
得先从箱子上下来。
&294 Don't worry. We have guards waiting for you that way.
&294 别担心。那个方向，我们已经安排了守卫等着各位。
&295 Go ahead, try and escape.
&295 请便，尽管试着逃吧。
What a large machine.
好大一台机器。
It looks like a toolshed.
看着像个工具柜。
The gun. I got it out.
枪。我拿到了。
I don't need to look at that now.
现在不用看那个。
It looks like a map of the ventilation system in the center.
像是整个中心的通风系统示意图。
It should open the top door.
应该能打开上面的门。
This is where the replacement pipe should go.
新管子应该装在这里。
It's broken. I need to replace it.
坏了。得换掉。
It's fixed.
修好了。
I need to use the side panel.
得用侧面的控制板。
A small, light, metallic crate.
一个又小又轻的金属箱。
I think it controls the steam valves.
应该是控制蒸汽阀的。
I don't want to close it by accident.
别不小心把它关上。
The steam must have knocked it out of the slot. I'll have to secure it somehow.
蒸汽准是把它从槽里冲出来了。得想办法固定住。
I can't reach it like this.
这样够不着。
Agh. Almost had it.
啊。差一点。
Yes! Got it!
好！成了！
I got the ropes free. I can move my hands now.
绳子解开了。手能动了。
I don't think I should move. He could overpower me again in a second.
我还是别动。他一眨眼就能再把我制住。
It's too blunt to cut the ropes.
太钝了，割不断绳子。
I already cut the ropes.
绳子已经割断了。
Agh. I can't reach it with my hands.
啊。手够不着。
A broken glass shard... It must've broke off during the malfunction.
一块玻璃碎片……准是故障时崩下来的。
Agh. I can't get them loose.
啊。解不开。
I can't reach it with my feet.
脚够不着。
The ropes are keeping my hands tied to the pipe.
绳子把我的手绑在管子上。
That's where the steam comes out from.
蒸汽就是从那儿冒出来的。
There's nothing to do with it there.
在那儿用不上它。
It must lead further back into the machinery sections.
应该是通向更里面的机械区。
I can just use my hands.
用手就行。
I need to get my hands free first.
得先把手解开。
There's no use for that there.
那个在那儿没用。
I'd need my hands free to do that.
得先腾出手才行。
I can't chew through them.
咬不断。
