&429 It doesn't matter to me if his name is Delta-Six or Azriel, or if he thinks he's one person or the other.
&429 他叫Delta-Six也好，叫阿兹瑞尔也好，他自己觉得是哪一个，对我来说都无所谓。
&430 Because I know that he's still the same person on the inside, the person I know who saved me, with or without a past.
&430 因为我知道，他骨子里还是同一个人——那个我认识的、救过我的人，有没有过去都一样。
&431 I'll be right back.
&431 我马上回来。
&204 Hurry up and get in.
&204 快点，上来。
&205 One of the weather towers malfunctioned. The atmosphere isn't safe anymore.
&205 一座气象塔出了故障。大气不安全了。
&1616 But that weather tower wasn't operational.
&1616 可那座气象塔根本没在运转。
&1617 ...Nevermind.
&1617 ……算了。
&206 Who's the girl?
&206 那姑娘是谁？
&1618 Her name-
&1618 她叫——
&432 My name is Sayuri.
&432 我叫纱由里。
&433 I escaped from Center 7 almost a year ago.
&433 我从第七中心逃出来，快一年了。
&207 Are you going to help us break in?
&207 你会帮我们闯进去吗？
&434 I hope so.
&434 希望吧。
&208 Let's plug in the data packet and I'll plot the course.
&208 把数据包接上，我来定航线。
&137 So you escaped from Center 7?
&137 这么说，你从第七中心逃出来了？
&435 Yes... that was almost a year ago.
&435 嗯……快一年了。
&138 That means you were a patient there...
&138 那你以前是那里的病人……
&436 Yes...
&436 是的……
&139 So... you don't remember who you were, right?
&139 那……你不记得自己以前是谁了，对吧？
&437 I know who I am now, and that's all that matters.
&437 我知道自己现在是谁，这就够了。
&140 But you have no memory beyond a year ago.
&140 可一年以前的事，你什么都不记得。
&438 ...That's right...
&438 ……没错……
&1619 Are you going to help us break in?
&1619 你会帮我们闯进去吗？
&1620 Do you have anything that can help us? Schematics? Codes?
&1620 你有什么能帮上忙的？图纸？密码？
&439 No... not like that...
&439 没有……不是那种东西……
&440 I escaped through the maintenance sections.
&440 我是从维护区逃出来的。
&441 I made my way to the docking bay, hopped on a freighter, and I got out when it arrived on Barracus.
&441 我一路摸到对接舱，跳上一艘货船，等船到了巴拉库斯就下来了。
&1621 So you know part of the layout?
&1621 那你多少知道点里面的布局？
&442 Yes, if you put it that way.
&442 嗯，可以这么说。
&443 ...If you docked and got in through the maintenance areas, I could probably find my way around.
&443 ……要是先对接，再从维护区进去，我大概认得路。
&1622 I'll tell you when we get there then.
&1622 那到了我再告诉你。
&141 Oh, and Az.
&141 哦，对了，阿兹。
&142 I thought I should stick around, you know.
&142 我寻思着，还是留下来吧。
&143 Just in case I could help.
&143 说不定能帮上忙。
&144 Now that Kane finally trusts me, that is.
&144 反正凯恩总算信得过我了。
&1623 Fine with me.
&1623 我没意见。
&145 After we get your brother could you drop me off at Colony 4?
&145 等我们把你兄弟弄出来，能顺路把我放到四号殖民地吗？
&146 I need to catch up with my family.
&146 我得回去看看家里人。
&1624 I'm sure Kane won't mind.
&1624 凯恩肯定不会介意。
&1625 You want to help us enter the facility?
&1625 你想帮我们进那座设施？
&147 You know I said I was never going to pick up a gun again.
&147 你知道，我说过再也不碰枪了。
&1626 Just checking.
&1626 随便问问。
&209 We're locked in a course.  We'll be there in seven hours.
&209 航线锁定了。七小时后到。
&210 Azriel. You wanna tackle that plan now or later?
&210 阿兹瑞尔。那计划你想现在过一遍，还是等会儿？
&1627 Now's fine.
&1627 现在就行。
&148 So...
&148 那么……
&149 Why are you coming exactly?
&149 你到底为什么要跟来？
&150 You don't even know Azriel's brother...
&150 你根本不认识阿兹瑞尔的兄弟……
&151 You have your own reasons, don't you...?
&151 你有自己的理由，对吧……？
&444 I left someone behind when I escaped...
&444 我逃走的时候，丢下了一个人……
&445 I need to find out what happened to him. That's all.
&445 我得查清他后来怎么了。就这些。
&1628 What is it?
&1628 怎么了？
&152 I've got the coordinates on that tracking device.
&152 我收到那个追踪器的坐标了。
&211 So you can find him then?
&211 那你能找到他了？
&153 Assuming Azriel's brother is still alive, yes.
&153 只要阿兹瑞尔的兄弟还活着，就能。
&212 So where'd they take him?
&212 那他们把他带哪儿去了？
&154 That's the problem.
&154 问题就在这儿。
&155 I've lost contact with the tracer.
&155 我跟追踪器失去联系了。
&1629 What do you mean?
&1629 什么意思？
&156 I mean it went into the Helix nebula and the signal doesn't carry with that much interference.
&156 意思是它进了螺旋星云，干扰太强，信号传不出来。
&446 What about it?
&446 它怎么了？
&158 It says Epsilon-Five, doesn't it?
&158 上面写着 Epsilon-Five，对吧？
&159 I heard they remove it during the surgery...
&159 我听说手术的时候会把它取掉……
&161 What's that?
&161 那是什么？
&213 It's our plan.
&213 是我们的计划。
&214 So I've pin-pointed the coordinates of the asteroid containing Center 7 deep inside the nebula.
&214 我已经精确定位了藏在星云深处那颗小行星的坐标——第七中心就在里面。
&215 It's gonna be a pain to navigate, but we should be able to find it.
&215 开进去会很费劲，但应该能找到。
&216 Communications and sensors get knocked out from the electro-magnetism, so we should be able to reach the asteroid undetected.
&216 电磁会干掉通讯和传感器，我们应该能一路摸到那颗小行星，不会被发现。
&217 Once we get within range, we can use the nebula as a screen and maneuver the ship under the back side of the asteroid where they don't have any sensors.
&217 一旦进入范围，就能拿星云当掩护，把船绕到小行星背面——那边没有传感器。
&218 Now... according to this blueprint, there's an exhaust shaft right here, which looks like our best point of entry.
&218 好……照这张图纸看，这里有一条排气竖井，像是我们最好的入口。
&219 This would lead straight into the back maintenance sections of the station, where they don't have any guards.
&219 它直通空间站后部的维护区，那儿没有守卫。
&220 Once you're inside you can access terminal computers here--and find out where ... your brother is, Azriel.
&220 你们一进去，就能在这儿接入终端——查出……你兄弟在哪儿，阿兹瑞尔。
&162 What if they've already erased his memory?
&162 要是他们已经清除了他的记忆呢？
&221 It says they store the memories of their patients on backup databanks.
&221 上面说，他们把病人的记忆存在备份数据库里。
&222 You can access those from the terminal rooms.
&222 从终端室就能调取。
&447 So you can find out who and where all the other patients have gone?
&447 那就能查到其他病人都是谁、去了哪里？
&223 Yes... but I'm not sure if I would even want my old memory back if I were you.
&223 能……不过换作是我，都不确定还想不想要回从前的记忆。
&163 And why is that...?
&163 为什么这么说……？
&224 Would you like to wake up one day and discover you were another person entirely?
&224 你愿意哪天一觉醒来，发现自己原本完全是另一个人吗？
&164 Mmm... No.
&164 唔……不愿意。
&225 ...Sayuri... does this blueprint look familiar to you?
&225 ……纱由里……这张图纸你眼熟吗？
&448 If it leads into the maintenance shaft, I know where to go.
&448 只要通向维护竖井，我就知道往哪走。
&226 Alright then... Matthius and I will stay on the ship after we dock.
&226 那好……对接之后，我和马蒂斯留在船上。
&227 Then you--Azriel, and Sayuri can enter from the back.
&227 然后你——阿兹瑞尔，还有纱由里，从后面进去。
&165 Sounds good to me. I'll stay on the ship.
&165 我觉得行。我留在船上。
&228 Okay. I'll start heading into the nebula now.
&228 好。我这就朝星云开进去。
&229 Whenever you're ready, I'll start the descent.
&229 你们准备好，我就开始下降。
&1630 We're not docked. I can't leave the ship.
&1630 还没对接。我下不了船。
