To Hatch
去舱门
&230 Hold on, I'll get us out of here!
&230 抓稳了，我这就带大家出去！
&231 We've made it out. We're safe.
&231 我们逃出来了。安全了。
&449 And the director?
&449 那院长呢？
&232 Dead, I'd assume.
&232 多半死了。
&450 The patients?
&450 那些病人呢？
&233 They got off on that other transport.
&233 他们搭另一艘运输船跑了。
&234 Do you realize what we've just done?
&234 你知道我们刚干了什么吗？
&451 We stopped them. We stopped the Boryokudan-
&451 我们阻止了他们。我们阻止了暴力团——
&235 And now they're gonna go back to killing them instead.
&235 现在他们只会直接杀人了。
&452 I would rather be dead than live again without knowing it.
&452 我宁可死，也不愿浑然不知地重活一次。
&236 Then why not kill Azriel now?
&236 那为什么不现在就杀了阿兹瑞尔？
&237 He doesn't know who we are. I don't know who he is.
&237 他不知道我们是谁。我也不知道他是谁。
&238 He's not the same person as before.
&238 他已经不是从前那个人了。
&239 All his memories, his past, his emotions...
&239 他所有的记忆、过去、情感……
&240 ...They don't exist anymore.
&240 ……都不复存在了。
&453 Is that all we are?
&453 我们就只是这些吗？
&454 Our memories?
&454 只是我们的记忆？
&455 Even though we couldn't remember anything, we weren't all evil in Center 7. We stuck together.
&455 就算我们什么都记不得，在第七中心也并非人人都坏。我们守在一起。
&456 We knew who we were.
&456 我们知道自己是谁。
&67 ...Maybe there's something besides your memories that makes you who you are.
&67 ……也许除了记忆之外，还有别的东西让你成为你自己。
&241 He doesn't even know who you are.
&241 他连你是谁都不知道。
&457 He doesn't have to.
&457 他不必知道。
&458 He only has who he is right now, and that's all that matters.
&458 他只有现在的自己，而这才是最重要的。
&459 He doesn't have to live a life of rue anymore.
&459 他不必再活在悔恨里了。
&166 Don't.  Move.
&166 别。动。
&242 So they already got him before we arrived.
&242 看来我们赶到之前，他们就已经抓到他了。
&1631 ...Guess so.
&1631 ……大概吧。
&243 And what about your friend here...
&243 那你这位朋友呢……
&244 What's his name?
&244 他叫什么？
&1632 Matthius. Used to work with him about five years back.
&1632 马蒂斯。大概五年前和他共过事。
&1633 He defected to--
&1633 他叛逃去了——
&167 Azriel!
&167 阿兹瑞尔！
&245 Ugh. Now what does he want?
&245 啧。他又想干什么？
&246 It's bad enough he wanted to hitch a ride with us off the planet.
&246 他非要蹭我们的船离开这星球，就已经够烦人了。
&1634 He left his family on Colony 4.
&1634 他把家人留在了四号殖民地。
&247 Oh.
&247 哦。
&248 Well then.
&248 那好吧。
&249 Okay... here we go.
&249 好了……我们开始。
&250 So we are... here.
&250 我们现在……在这儿。
&251 We're currently in orbit on Barracus.
&251 我们正在巴拉库斯轨道上。
&252 That other planet to the left is Colony 4.
&252 左边那颗行星是四号殖民地。
&253 That one over there is Harmony.
&253 那边那颗是哈莫尼。
&254 There are jump gates... here... and here.
&254 跃迁门在……这儿……还有这儿。
&255 Let's see where Center 7 is...
&255 看看第七中心在哪儿……
