&1635 What's that giant brown area?
&1635 那一大片棕色区域是什么？
&256 That's the gas nebula on the top side of the galaxy, the one that's causing us so many problems.
&256 那是银河上方的气体星云，就是给我们惹了这么多麻烦的那个。
&257 So far it's uncharted, and for good reason.
&257 至今没人测绘过，这不是没道理的。
&258 The radiation is supposed to wipe you out if you enter.
&258 据说谁进去，辐射就会把谁干掉。
&259 It says here that the prison was carved out of a giant asteroid in the center of the nebula.
&259 这上面说，监狱是在星云中心一颗巨型小行星里凿出来的。
&260 I don't know about the radiation effect on the ship...
&260 辐射对船有什么影响，我说不准……
&261 As long as we don't stay in the center for a long time, we should be able to make it through.
&261 只要不在星云中心待太久，应该就能闯过去。
&262 I'll plug in the coordinates and plot our course of descent when we get near.
&262 我先输坐标，等靠近了再定降落航线。
&1636 You want to draft up a plan?
&1636 要不要拟个计划？
&263 Give me a minute.
&263 给我点时间。
&1637 I'll be in the other room.
&1637 我去隔壁。
&168 Did we make it?
&168 我们闯过来了吗？
&264 Yeah, but I thought for sure we were spotted.  Their sensors were right on us.
&264 是啊，可我敢肯定我们被发现了。他们的传感器一直对着我们。
&169 Maybe the radiation interfered with the signal.
&169 也许是辐射干扰了信号。
&265 Ok, Az. Your go.
&265 好了，阿兹。该你了。
&266 Good luck. Find your brother. I'll keep an eye on the ship.
&266 祝你好运。找到你兄弟。船我盯着。
&1638 You ready, Sayuri?
&1638 准备好了吗，纱由里？
&460 Lead the way.
&460 你带路吧。
&267 We all here?
&267 都到齐了吗？
&170 Yep.
&170 嗯。
&269 Okay...
&269 好……
&270 I'll start heading into the nebula now.
&270 我现在就驶向星云。
&271 Hold on, this might get a little rough.
&271 抓稳了，接下来可能会有点颠。
&91 Warning, hull temperature decreasing at rapid rate.
&91 警告，船体温度急速下降。
&1640 Are you sure we're gonna make it?
&1640 你确定我们能挺过去吗？
&272 ...We should hold together.
&272 ……我们应该挺得住。
&92 Warning, deflection shields failing.
&92 警告，力场护盾正在失效。
&171 This doesn't sound good.
&171 这听起来可不妙。
&172 Uh...
&172 呃……
&273 We'll hold together!
&273 我们挺得住！
&274 Azriel, look at that radar and update my position.
&274 阿兹瑞尔，看看那台雷达，把我的位置报一下。
&1641 We've already landed.
&1641 我们已经着陆了。
&1642 I've got no idea how to use this thing.
&1642 我不知道这东西怎么用。
&1643 Some kind of console used for instruments and such.
&1643 某种控制台，用来操作仪器之类的。
&1644 Kane!
&1644 凯恩！
&1002 What?
&1002 干嘛？
&1645 A little help here?
&1645 能搭把手吗？
&275 I'm a little preoccupied right now!
&275 我这会儿忙着呢！
&1646 Matt.
&1646 马特。
&173 Yes...?
&173 什么事……？
&1647 You have any ideas on how to fix this?
&1647 你有办法修好它吗？
&174 Beats me.
&174 问倒我了。
&1648 Sayuri!
&1648 纱由里！
&461 Hmm?
&461 嗯？
&1649 Can you give me a hand?
&1649 能帮我一把吗？
&462 I don't see what the problem is. I think the ship is just really old.
&462 我看不出问题在哪。我觉得这船只是太旧了。
&276 Hey!
&276 喂！
&1650 I don't want to destroy it.
&1650 我不想弄坏它。
&277 You better not.
&277 你最好别。
&1651 That'll just get me electrocuted.
&1651 那只会电死我。
